Package: command-quiver
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Andrea Bonacci <delivery@linkalab.it>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gnome-terminal
Homepage: https://github.com/AndreaBonn/command-quiver
Description: Personal library of AI prompts and shell commands
 Command Quiver is a GTK4 desktop application for the GNOME desktop that keeps a
 searchable, sectioned library of AI prompts and shell commands. Prompts are
 copied to the clipboard; shell commands run in gnome-terminal. Entries are
 stored in a local SQLite database and can be synced across devices through a
 private GitHub repository.
